<title>USA: Cooper Cos to redeem debentures.</title>
<headline>Cooper Cos to redeem debentures.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTON, Calif. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Cos Inc said it will call for redemption on April 9 all $9.3 million principal amount of its 10-5/8 percent convertible subordinated reset debentures due March 1, 2005 at 100 percent of principal value, plus unpaid interest through the redemption date.</p>
<p>As an alternative to redemption, holders may convert at the rate of $15 per share their debentures into shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the redemption is not expected to be dilutive to 1997 earnings.</p>
</text>
